⚠️ Warning
This repository contains intentionally destructive example code.
If the user enters the value 67, the program attempts to execute operating system commands that can delete files or damage the operating system:
Windows: attempts to delete files, format the C: drive, and remove the Windows directory.
Linux/Unix: attempts to execute rm -rf / --no-preserve-root, which can erase the entire filesystem if run with sufficient privileges.
Do not run this program on any real system. It is provided solely for code analysis, security awareness, or educational discussion. Running it may result in irreversible data loss.
Consider using a virtual machine or isolated sandbox if you need to inspect or analyze the code. Never execute it on a computer containing important data.
